                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The goblin makes quick \"improvements\" to a frag grenade and throws it using Area Fire. The grenade deals an additional @Damage[1d8[untyped]] damage of a random type, with a random additional effect on a critical failure (roll a 1d6: 1—electricity and @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Glitching]{Glitching 1}, 2—poison and @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Suppressed] for 1 round, 3—fire and 1 persistent fire damage, 4—cold and @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Enfeebled]{Enfeebled 1} for 1 round, 5—acid and @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1}, or 6–sonic and @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Deafened] for 1 round).</p>"
